          "end": 120.15,
          "en": "without having to go through all the code on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.15,
          "end": 121.71,
          "en": "Though of course, as always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.71,
          "end": 125.586,
          "en": "you should keep in mind that ChatGPT makes mistakes.",
